OL,3,GNEWSAPedicabs in London must now be
OL,4,Alicensed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe regulations have received a mixed
OL,7,Fresponse from drivers and operators,
OL,8,Fwith most welcoming the changes but
OL,9,Fsome raising concerns about the
OL,10,Fadditional costs to their businesses.
